            "content": "## ⚠️ Self-provoking trigger flow\n\nThe top lane creates a test order and updates its note a minute later one minute after the start — keep the first **Wait**: it lets the webhook subscription become active. The second **Wait** keeps the update apart from the creation, which the trigger skips. The test order is deleted after `AfterAll`."
